  "convention": "DT4N-L1 | y point-wise nghiem ngat: y[t]=1 <=> inject_tick < t <= revert_tick (suy ra tu: rate[t] do khoang (t-1,t] va inject chay trong on_tick SAU khi snapshot tick da flush). Goc thoi gian: t0_mono cua collector; event t_rel LA CHINH bien t_rel cua snapshot cung tick -> khop dong ho la dang thuc, khong phai sai so. Chi so CHINH: point-wise tren moi tick sau warmup, KHONG loai tick chuyen tiep. Chi so PHU (do nhay): loai dai chuyen tiep onset=2, recovery=2 tick. Grace KHONG nam trong y. Point-adjust KHONG duoc dung lam chi so chinh (Kim et al., AAAI 2022).",
